From: da-ai-xian-zun <163512031+da-ai-xian-zun@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:27:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] pipeline: simple: Add contrast-detect autofocus

Drive the focus lens from the soft ISP FocusFoM: a coarse scan over the
whole range, a finer scan around the best coarse position, then a move
to the sharpest position. Measurements only use frames exposed after the
lens settled. Continuous mode, the default as PipeWire and GStreamer
clients don't set AfMode, rescans when the figure of merit stays well
below its value at lock. Auto mode scans on AfTriggerStart and manual
mode keeps FocusAbsolute.

The scan strategy follows the TB520FU user-space autofocus daemon, the
control handling the contrast-detect autofocus by Osilvfe and mzak in
iceland-mainline.
